  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.133` to `4.1.134`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.133...application_builder_helpers/4.1.134)\n\n## What's Changed\n* template: gate WasmBuildNative to Release-only by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/392\n* Bump System.Security.Cryptography.Xml from 9.0.0 to 9.0.18 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/393\n* fix: decouple console output (#370) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/390\n* ApplicationHost: remove duplicate parallel sync RunPreparation by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/389\n* Bump NuGet.Packaging from 6.12.1 to 6.12.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/394\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20260909104207.12fc1fa...build.20260909173408.a99fa3c",
